# File: Caddyfile
# Description: Edge reverse proxy with TLS and HSTS (SEC-01)
# Author: Sri Yanto Qodarbaskoro
# Contact: sqodarbaskoro@gmail.com
# LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/sqodarbaskoro/
# Website: https://www.seismopilot.com
